WEBVTT

00:05.100 --> 00:06.640
<b>Hurry.</b>

00:09.710 --> 00:10.770
<b>Wait!</b>

00:11.110 --> 00:13.610
<b>-Omasa.
-Matataro.</b>

00:14.310 --> 00:15.610
<b>Take me with you.</b>

00:16.580 --> 00:17.610
<b>Matataro!</b>

00:18.350 --> 00:23.220
<b>Omasa, as a member of Will-o’-the-wisp,
you know that love affairs are banned between us.</b>

00:23.350 --> 00:26.160
<b>I can't keep on betraying my father like this.</b>

00:41.470 --> 00:43.670
<b>Matataro...</b>

01:01.360 --> 01:02.730
<b>Why...?</b>

01:03.430 --> 01:06.760
<b>What made me dream about 10 years ago?</b>

01:07.100 --> 01:09.730
<b>Yamadaya</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:16.610
<b>Will-o’-the-wisp</b>

02:18.400 --> 02:22.840
<b>Will-o’-the-wisp</b>

02:29.610 --> 02:31.850
<b>Cruel savages.</b>

02:32.210 --> 02:34.250
<b>I'll never be satisfied.</b>

02:37.250 --> 02:42.490
<b>Two crimes in Kyoto and Osaka in the spring
were associated with the Will-o’-the-wisp clan.</b>

02:42.630 --> 02:46.860
<b>It's safe to assume that they're now here in Edo.</b>

02:47.600 --> 02:49.470
<b>Omasa.</b>

02:50.300 --> 02:54.370
<b>If I remember correctly,
you said that the predecessor of the clan has died.</b>

02:54.500 --> 02:58.470
<b>-Yes.
-So these are his son's doings?</b>

02:58.610 --> 03:01.380
<b>No. It can't be.</b>

03:01.510 --> 03:03.410
<b>This can't be his son's doing.</b>

03:03.850 --> 03:06.720
<b>There's no way he would be this cruel.</b>

03:07.880 --> 03:09.720
<b>Omasa.</b>

03:13.190 --> 03:14.720
<b>Restaurant Yorozuya</b>

03:20.430 --> 03:24.230
<b>Omasa, why do you defend the successor
of Will-o’-the-wisp?</b>

03:24.370 --> 03:26.540
<b>When I worked under the predecessor,</b>

03:26.670 --> 03:28.270
<b>I was involved with his son.</b>

03:30.710 --> 03:31.910
<b>I see.</b>

03:32.240 --> 03:35.840
<b>"Do not rape, kill or steal from the poor."</b>

03:35.980 --> 03:37.910
<b>His son looked up to his father,</b>

03:38.250 --> 03:41.680
<b>who strictly enforced
the three principles of a thief.</b>

03:42.520 --> 03:46.320
<b>I cannot imagine him committing such crimes.</b>

03:46.460 --> 03:47.490
<b>Hey, Omasa.</b>

03:48.390 --> 03:52.960
<b>Even if he was a former lover of yours,</b>

03:53.300 --> 03:55.830
<b>we cannot overlook this act</b>

03:55.970 --> 04:00.400
<b>committed by a cold-blooded villain.</b>

04:00.540 --> 04:02.970
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

04:03.310 --> 04:04.570
<b>You're absolutely right.</b>

04:05.770 --> 04:08.580
<b>I'm relying on you as a former member of the clan.</b>

04:09.240 --> 04:12.480
<b>-I need your cooperation.
-Of course.</b>

04:15.420 --> 04:18.650
<b>The predecessor had two sons:</b>

04:18.790 --> 04:20.520
<b>Matataro, the eldest,</b>

04:20.660 --> 04:22.790
<b>Bunkichi, the second son.</b>

04:24.430 --> 04:27.530
<b>It would make sense for Matataro,
the eldest, to succeed his father.</b>

04:27.660 --> 04:30.270
<b>But since he's the son of a mistress,</b>

04:30.400 --> 04:35.040
<b>it wouldn't be absurd if Bunkichi,
the lawful wife's son, succeeded his father.</b>

04:35.370 --> 04:39.010
<b>Of course. That must be it.</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:48.850
<b>Matataro can't be the successor.</b>

04:50.820 --> 04:52.820
<b>It can't be him.</b>

04:55.420 --> 04:57.460
<b>He didn't do this.</b>

04:57.860 --> 05:01.060
<b>What? On the day of the burglary?</b>

05:01.930 --> 05:06.000
<b>A female pilgrim collapsed on the ground
in front of the shop that got robbed.</b>

05:06.340 --> 05:08.470
<b>She was taken inside the shop.</b>

05:09.840 --> 05:12.370
<b>She must've been around 30.</b>

05:18.350 --> 05:21.780
<b>That woman must be Osen, the spy.</b>

05:21.920 --> 05:25.990
<b>She disguised herself as a pilgrim and acted
as an informant during the predecessor's days.</b>

05:26.320 --> 05:28.990
<b>There must be a hideout somewhere.</b>

05:29.320 --> 05:33.360
<b>But Will-o’-the-wisp's usual territory
is the Kyoto and Osaka region.</b>

05:33.500 --> 05:35.560
<b>There's no lead here.</b>

05:36.430 --> 05:38.700
<b>Wait, there's one person.</b>

05:38.830 --> 05:42.640
<b>There's only one other person in Edo
who knows more about the clan than I do.</b>

05:43.910 --> 05:45.970
<b>Niijuku, Katsushika</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:52.450
<b>Omasa?!</b>

05:55.450 --> 05:56.450
<b>It's been a while.</b>

05:56.590 --> 05:58.020
<b>Genshichi of Setogawa.</b>

05:58.350 --> 05:59.760
<b>How did you know?</b>

05:59.960 --> 06:04.090
<b>I remembered seeing you here before.</b>

06:05.630 --> 06:07.130
<b>Is that true?</b>

06:07.900 --> 06:09.470
<b>You're too loud.</b>

06:09.600 --> 06:13.440
<b>I'm out of the business,
so I prefer to not be involved at all.</b>

06:13.570 --> 06:16.110
<b>Forgive me, but is that really true?</b>

06:16.840 --> 06:18.910
<b>Yeah, that was four years ago,</b>

06:19.040 --> 06:21.540
<b>right before the predecessor passed away.</b>

06:21.680 --> 06:24.150
<b>He declared it in front of everyone.</b>

06:24.480 --> 06:26.920
<b>"Matataro is my successor."</b>

06:29.920 --> 06:32.790
<b>Take my word for it. I was there.</b>

06:32.920 --> 06:35.920
<b>Then the Ichigaya case...</b>

06:36.590 --> 06:38.860
<b>Ichigaya? Did something happen?</b>

06:38.990 --> 06:40.700
<b>No...</b>

06:40.830 --> 06:43.930
<b>But Matataro's still in the Kyoto vicinity, right?</b>

06:44.070 --> 06:45.600
<b>Please say yes.</b>

06:45.730 --> 06:49.770
<b>I thought Matataro was with you!</b>

06:49.910 --> 06:52.470
<b>What? Why would you think that?</b>

06:52.610 --> 06:54.440
<b>This was just the other day.</b>

06:58.710 --> 07:01.580
<b>He walked right past, without noticing me.</b>

07:01.720 --> 07:06.660
<b>But I assumed that he was here
to see you, Omasa.</b>

07:06.790 --> 07:08.960
<b>Matataro's in Edo...</b>

07:09.560 --> 07:12.490
<b>I've never seen him so tense before.</b>

07:12.630 --> 07:14.760
<b>He was almost unrecognizable.</b>

07:15.200 --> 07:17.030
<b>But that was definitely Matataro.</b>

07:19.640 --> 07:21.670
<b>Was that Genshichi of Setogawa?</b>

07:25.140 --> 07:26.480
<b>Omasa.</b>

07:30.050 --> 07:31.680
<b>How did you track this place?</b>

07:31.810 --> 07:35.680
<b>Once you leave a mark, it never disappears.</b>

07:35.820 --> 07:39.220
<b>Anyway, I heard Matataro's in town.</b>

07:39.560 --> 07:42.790
<b>-Is that true?
-You were listening.</b>

07:43.560 --> 07:45.690
<b>Where is he now?</b>

07:46.700 --> 07:48.900
<b>In any case, we must notify Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

07:49.030 --> 07:50.770
<b>Wait!</b>

07:51.230 --> 07:54.170
<b>We still don't know if it was really him.</b>

07:54.500 --> 07:58.570
<b>Please tell Mr. Hasegawa to do no harm
if you catch him.</b>

07:58.710 --> 08:01.710
<b>That's for Mr. Hasegawa to decide.</b>

08:02.980 --> 08:05.250
<b>-But...
-Omasa.</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:08.720
<b>You're deeply affected by Matataro.</b>

08:08.850 --> 08:10.190
<b>Omasa.</b>

08:10.520 --> 08:13.990
<b>Time allows a person to change rather drastically.</b>

08:14.960 --> 08:16.890
<b>Sometimes they become unrecognizable.</b>

08:19.030 --> 08:21.000
<b>Keep that in mind.</b>

08:23.930 --> 08:25.830
<b>Don't worry, Omasa.</b>

08:25.970 --> 08:29.540
<b>I'll inform Tetsu of the situation for you.</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:31.940
<b>Thanks, Hikojyu.</b>

08:34.810 --> 08:36.580
<b>Omasa.</b>

08:37.210 --> 08:38.810
<b>Who were they?</b>

08:39.550 --> 08:42.550
<b>They're just some other thieves I work with.</b>

08:42.990 --> 08:47.260
<b>Genshichi, can I trouble you for one favor?</b>

08:48.120 --> 08:50.660
<b>If Matataro comes by,</b>

08:51.290 --> 08:53.660
<b>will you please tell him to meet me here?</b>

08:54.730 --> 08:57.100
<b>Well, of course. Sure thing.</b>

08:57.830 --> 08:59.300
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:59.640 --> 09:00.870
<b>Oh, hey!</b>

09:05.240 --> 09:07.140
<b>Inn</b>

09:13.850 --> 09:17.090
<b>I see. Thank you.</b>

09:20.090 --> 09:21.960
<b>Where are you?</b>

09:22.090 --> 09:23.290
<b>Matataro...</b>

09:25.160 --> 09:28.130
<b>I've tracked down Genshichi of Setogawa.</b>

09:28.260 --> 09:30.870
<b>He could be connected with the man.</b>

09:31.000 --> 09:32.700
<b>What do you think, successor?</b>

09:44.880 --> 09:46.720
<b>Sakamoto Uramachi
Yosuke Tenement House</b>

09:53.020 --> 09:55.290
<b>Are you Genshichi's messenger?</b>

09:55.620 --> 09:58.230
<b>Yeah! Open up! Genshichi's in a lot of trouble!</b>

09:58.960 --> 10:01.800
<b>Hold on. I'll be right there.</b>

10:14.880 --> 10:16.040
<b>She's gone.</b>

10:16.210 --> 10:17.650
<b>Chase her!</b>

10:39.800 --> 10:41.700
<b>You're a rebellious one, aren't you?</b>

10:52.410 --> 10:54.980
<b>You'll pay for this!</b>

11:06.160 --> 11:07.860
<b>Bunkichi.</b>

11:08.360 --> 11:09.870
<b>Where's my brother?</b>

11:10.000 --> 11:12.200
<b>Where's Matataro?</b>

11:12.330 --> 11:15.800
<b>I don't know. I'm searching for him too.</b>

11:15.940 --> 11:19.210
<b>All I know is that he's in Edo.</b>

11:19.340 --> 11:22.840
<b>You'll pay me with your life!</b>

11:22.980 --> 11:25.980
<b>She's my brother's beloved woman.</b>

11:29.080 --> 11:31.150
<b>I'm the one who gets to have my way with her.</b>

11:44.100 --> 11:45.230
<b>Matataro!</b>

11:50.270 --> 11:53.110
<b>This isn't good.</b>

11:53.840 --> 11:55.710
<b>Fire! Fire!</b>

11:56.710 --> 11:59.150
<b>There's a fire!</b>

11:59.280 --> 12:01.950
<b>That voice. It's Hikojyu.</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:03.450
<b>What's going on?</b>

12:03.790 --> 12:06.120
<b>Where's the fire?</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:18.930
<b>-Where's this fire?
-Hey, why don't you go check on it?</b>

12:19.070 --> 12:22.470
<b>Omasa, where'd you go?! Omasa!</b>

12:23.810 --> 12:25.510
<b>Shinagawa, Iseya Inn</b>

12:26.810 --> 12:28.840
<b>It's been a while, Omasa.</b>

12:28.980 --> 12:30.480
<b>Yes, it has, successor.</b>

12:31.310 --> 12:34.920
<b>Stop, just call me Matataro. Just like you used to.</b>

12:37.290 --> 12:38.950
<b>Matataro.</b>

12:39.090 --> 12:40.820
<b>Why are you in Edo?</b>

12:40.960 --> 12:44.360
<b>In order to stop the fake Will-o’-the-wisp leader,
Bunkichi.</b>

12:44.490 --> 12:47.900
<b>So the Ichigaya case wasn't you.</b>

12:48.030 --> 12:52.500
<b>It was Bunkichi's doing. Before this,
he did two other jobs in the Kyoto vicinity.</b>

12:52.830 --> 12:55.070
<b>A rough job is a rough job.</b>

12:55.200 --> 12:58.970
<b>I can't let him go on like this,
disrespecting Will-o’-the-wisp's name.</b>

12:59.110 --> 13:02.480
<b>The name the predecessor protected all his life.</b>

13:02.810 --> 13:05.310
<b>Then, Matataro, you...</b>

13:05.450 --> 13:08.980
<b>It's been four years since I succeeded him.</b>

13:09.120 --> 13:14.420
<b>And I've only done one big job that abided
by the three principles of a thief.</b>

13:17.990 --> 13:19.430
<b>I see.</b>

13:19.560 --> 13:23.500
<b>But it looks as though Bunkichi didn't like
what was happening.</b>

13:24.900 --> 13:31.910
<b>He couldn't stomach the fact that the concubine's child
was chosen as the successor.</b>

13:33.070 --> 13:35.240
<b>Matataro.</b>

13:35.380 --> 13:36.950
<b>Today in Edo,</b>

13:37.080 --> 13:41.250
<b>a man named Heizo Hasegawa is the chief
of Arson Theft Control.</b>

13:41.380 --> 13:44.120
<b>I've heard rumors. He's known as the "Oni."</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:47.490
<b>He never tolerates evil.</b>

13:47.820 --> 13:50.830
<b>It might be best to leave Bunkichi to Onihei</b>

13:50.960 --> 13:53.430
<b>and for you to go back to the Kyoto vicinity.</b>

13:54.330 --> 13:56.460
<b>Thanks for being concerned about me.</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:00.240
<b>But, Omasa...</b>

14:00.370 --> 14:05.170
<b>When it comes to Bunkichi, I have to be the one
who finishes him with my own hands.</b>

14:05.310 --> 14:08.280
<b>What do you intend to do to Bunkichi?</b>

14:08.410 --> 14:10.080
<b>I'll sit him down and convince him</b>

14:10.210 --> 14:14.450
<b>to go back to Kyoto with me
so I can hammer in the proper ways of a thief.</b>

14:14.580 --> 14:16.050
<b>But...</b>

14:16.590 --> 14:19.620
<b>what if he resists you?</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:22.020
<b>If that happens...</b>

14:22.590 --> 14:25.890
<b>Understood. At this point, I cannot stop you.</b>

14:26.030 --> 14:27.060
<b>You know me.</b>

14:27.460 --> 14:30.330
<b>But you must let me help you.</b>

14:30.470 --> 14:33.900
<b>No, it's too dangerous. I can't get you involved in it.</b>

14:34.440 --> 14:37.370
<b>Matataro, you're not too familiar with Edo, are you?</b>

14:37.510 --> 14:38.870
<b>Well...</b>

14:39.010 --> 14:41.340
<b>And, plus...</b>

14:41.480 --> 14:43.110
<b>Omasa...</b>

14:44.580 --> 14:47.020
<b>Aren't you exhausted after all this today?</b>

14:47.150 --> 14:48.880
<b>You should get some rest.</b>

14:49.990 --> 14:52.920
<b>Omasa, I wanted to see you. All this time...</b>

14:53.660 --> 14:55.460
<b>But...</b>

15:06.130 --> 15:07.500
<b>Damn it.</b>

15:08.100 --> 15:09.670
<b>Don't worry, boss.</b>

15:10.010 --> 15:13.380
<b>-We'll get them no matter what.
-Don't call me "boss."</b>

15:15.010 --> 15:16.680
<b>I'm the successor.</b>

15:17.650 --> 15:20.250
<b>You're very particular, successor.</b>

15:20.380 --> 15:23.180
<b>I paid you, so you better get them.</b>

15:23.320 --> 15:25.950
<b>Yeah, as long as you pay me,</b>

15:26.090 --> 15:30.130
<b>I'll do anything you want.</b>

15:33.700 --> 15:34.960
<b>Next Day
Gotetsu</b>

15:35.100 --> 15:36.560
<b>Omasa's gone?</b>

15:36.700 --> 15:41.470
<b>Hikojyu and I got concerned
and checked up on her last night.</b>

15:41.600 --> 15:44.210
<b>She was being confronted by the thieves.</b>

15:44.340 --> 15:45.470
<b>We tried to follow her.</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:48.240
<b>But a journeyer came and saved her.</b>

15:48.380 --> 15:50.180
<b>Was it Matataro?</b>

15:50.580 --> 15:52.580
<b>She must be with him right now.</b>

15:52.710 --> 15:56.020
<b>I'm sure Omasa has something on her mind.</b>

15:56.150 --> 15:59.190
<b>Of course, she must.</b>

15:59.690 --> 16:03.630
<b>In any case, we must find them first,
before we get to the thieves.</b>

16:03.960 --> 16:05.090
<b>Help me out, will you?</b>

16:05.230 --> 16:06.390
<b>-Yes, sir.
-Of course.</b>

16:19.270 --> 16:22.480
<b>Omasa? I just saw her this morning.</b>

16:22.610 --> 16:25.550
<b>Saw her come out of an inn with a man.</b>

16:26.250 --> 16:29.980
<b>They looked pretty intimate to me.</b>

16:30.120 --> 16:31.590
<b>Do you know where they went?</b>

16:31.720 --> 16:33.520
<b>Not a clue.</b>

16:33.660 --> 16:36.090
<b>But they weren't carrying any luggage,</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:39.260
<b>so they might come back to the inn tonight.</b>

16:39.390 --> 16:42.030
<b>But anyway, what's going on?</b>

16:42.160 --> 16:45.370
<b>I had another woman asking about Omasa
just a few moments ago.</b>

16:46.300 --> 16:48.400
<b>She was an unfamiliar face.</b>

16:48.540 --> 16:52.240
<b>Did you tell her where the inn was?</b>

16:52.370 --> 16:55.640
<b>Well, yeah, she told me she was an old comrade.</b>

16:57.450 --> 17:00.420
<b>Iseya Vicinity</b>

17:01.250 --> 17:03.390
<b>It's around here somewhere.</b>

17:36.720 --> 17:38.590
<b>Wait here.</b>

17:38.720 --> 17:40.760
<b>Let me go with you.</b>

17:46.390 --> 17:49.260
<b>It's confirmed.
They're at an inn in Shinagawa called Iseya.</b>

17:49.400 --> 17:51.530
<b>-We'll get them at night!
-Yeah!</b>

17:51.670 --> 17:52.800
<b>We'll kill them.</b>

17:53.130 --> 17:54.400
<b>Not so fast.</b>

17:54.540 --> 17:57.170
<b>Now that Osen knows,</b>

17:57.310 --> 18:00.480
<b>I doubt that they'll go back to the same inn.</b>

18:00.610 --> 18:05.380
<b>Osen, did you really track them down?</b>

18:07.580 --> 18:10.150
<b>Of course I did.</b>

18:11.720 --> 18:16.860
<b>That's enough for today. Don't attempt to do anything
that'll dig your own grave.</b>

18:17.190 --> 18:20.460
<b>-Come on, now...
-What a drag.</b>

18:29.440 --> 18:33.210
<b>Bunkichi, just listen. Come back to Kyoto with me</b>

18:33.340 --> 18:36.180
<b>so I can teach you the proper ways of a thief.</b>

18:36.310 --> 18:38.650
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

18:39.850 --> 18:41.680
<b>The proper ways of a thief?</b>

18:41.820 --> 18:44.820
<b>You spend two to three years</b>

18:45.150 --> 18:47.690
<b>trying to scheme up a job,
sending spies to the target.</b>

18:47.820 --> 18:52.260
<b>The money doesn't make sense
when you waste so much time.</b>

18:52.790 --> 18:56.200
<b>We need that time to make sure
we don't harm anyone.</b>

18:56.330 --> 18:58.800
<b>That's the art of robbery.</b>

18:59.130 --> 19:03.240
<b>Do not rape, kill or steal from the poor?</b>

19:03.910 --> 19:05.870
<b>We're way past that time now.</b>

19:06.740 --> 19:09.880
<b>It's not about the times or what others think.</b>

19:11.180 --> 19:14.780
<b>It's about how you want to live
and how you want to be.</b>

19:14.920 --> 19:16.480
<b>That's the issue here.</b>

19:17.690 --> 19:19.390
<b>Don't look at me like that.</b>

19:20.420 --> 19:23.730
<b>A privileged person like you</b>

19:23.860 --> 19:26.900
<b>would never understand how I feel.</b>

19:27.230 --> 19:28.360
<b>What?</b>

19:28.500 --> 19:30.670
<b>It's always been like this.</b>

19:30.800 --> 19:35.200
<b>Everything I wanted already belonged to you.</b>

19:35.340 --> 19:38.340
<b>Talent, skill, popularity...</b>

19:39.270 --> 19:42.310
<b>And even the woman.</b>

19:45.450 --> 19:50.490
<b>But I endured it all. I accepted it as my fate.</b>

19:50.620 --> 19:55.590
<b>But when he appointed you as the successor,
it made me realize that I'd end up a loser</b>

19:55.720 --> 19:58.590
<b>if I didn't do anything about it.</b>

19:58.730 --> 19:59.730
<b>Bunkichi.</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:08.940
<b>That's why I won't put up with this anymore!</b>

20:10.410 --> 20:13.780
<b>Leave your name as the successor with me!</b>

20:17.610 --> 20:19.880
<b>This isn't good.</b>

20:30.730 --> 20:33.560
<b>This is Heizo Hasegawa of Arson Theft Control!</b>

20:34.900 --> 20:36.460
<b>Onihei...</b>

20:38.370 --> 20:41.240
<b>Rumor often spreads by itself.</b>

20:41.370 --> 20:43.470
<b>Let's see what you got.</b>

21:14.300 --> 21:18.510
<b>All right, brother. I'll go back to Kyoto.</b>

21:40.830 --> 21:44.730
<b>I'm no match for you, Matataro.</b>

21:46.030 --> 21:47.740
<b>Bunkichi...</b>

21:48.800 --> 21:52.740
<b>Farewell, successor.</b>

21:59.910 --> 22:02.350
<b>Matataro...</b>

22:07.720 --> 22:11.360
<b>You're the successor of Yuguro of Will-o’-the-wisp.</b>

22:12.430 --> 22:13.800
<b>No.</b>

22:13.930 --> 22:16.460
<b>No, he's a merchant from the Kyoto area,</b>

22:16.600 --> 22:18.530
<b>and his name is Imazuya.</b>

22:18.670 --> 22:19.800
<b>Omasa.</b>

22:19.930 --> 22:25.940
<b>Bunkichi's the one who killed the real successor
and committed all those rough jobs.</b>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.780
<b>This man only assisted in punishing the evil man!</b>

22:35.950 --> 22:38.820
<b>So the real successor died?</b>

22:38.950 --> 22:40.720
<b>Yes.</b>

22:42.990 --> 22:44.430
<b>Imazuya.</b>

22:44.560 --> 22:45.790
<b>Yes.</b>

22:46.490 --> 22:48.800
<b>I appreciate your help with this matter.</b>

22:49.830 --> 22:53.630
<b>But you are to never return to Edo again.</b>

22:53.770 --> 22:57.610
<b>Yes. Much obliged.</b>

23:09.080 --> 23:11.820
<b>-Are you here for me?
-Yes.</b>

23:11.950 --> 23:14.660
<b>It's about Matataro Imazuya.</b>

23:14.790 --> 23:16.420
<b>He died.</b>

23:16.560 --> 23:19.790
<b>It was a sudden death from an epidemic in Kyoto.</b>

23:19.930 --> 23:23.030
<b>As he was dying, he left these words for you.</b>

23:24.030 --> 23:27.670
<b>"Find happiness, Omasa."</b>

23:28.970 --> 23:31.840
<b>La la la</b>

23:34.110 --> 23:38.080
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:40.920 --> 23:46.850
<b>…and then…fall</b>
